  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the bottom of a large clay pot or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, cumin, coriander, cinnamon, and cayenne pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the bell peppers, chicken broth, honey, and olives. Bring to a boil.",
    "Cover the pot and transfer it to the oven. Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in the parsley and season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
